---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - தனியுரிமைக் கொள்கை | FYC Connect"
  description="Privacy Policy and Data Protection for FYC Connect Platform & Friends Youth Club"
>
  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden text-white" style="min-height:180px;background:#030C06;">
    <div class="aurora-bg absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
      <div class="aurora-blob-1" style="position:absolute;left:-60px;top:-60px;width:300px;height:300px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(15,81,50,0.60);"></div>
      <div class="aurora-blob-2" style="position:absolute;right:-40px;top:20px;width:260px;height:260px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(22,163,74,0.35);"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center py-12 px-4">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-green-100 text-sm sm:text-base">
        Last updated: August 2026 · Friends Youth Club (FYC Connect)
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content -->
  <section class="py-12 px-4 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10 space-y-8 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          Friends Youth Club ("FYC", "we", "us", or "our") operates the FYC Connect mobile application and website (<a href="https://fycconnect.com" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">fycconnect.com</a>). We are dedicated to protecting your personal privacy and providing a safe, transparent experience for all members, volunteers, and community participants.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">We collect minimal information necessary to deliver community services, manage club events, and enable verified member communication:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Account & Profile Information:</strong> Name, phone number, email address (if signing in via Google), and optional profile photograph.</li>
          <li><strong>Authentication & Verification:</strong> Phone number verification data via SMS One-Time Passwords (OTP) and Google/Firebase Phone Number Verification (PNV) cryptographic tokens.</li>
          <li><strong>Community & Activity Data:</strong> Volunteer participation, blood donor availability (only with your explicit opt-in), event registrations, and civic issues submitted.</li>
          <li><strong>Device & Notification Data:</strong> Device token for push notifications (FCM) to deliver urgent community alerts and event updates.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li>To verify member identity and maintain secure access to club activities.</li>
          <li>To facilitate emergency blood donor connections when you have explicitly registered as a donor.</li>
          <li>To organize sports tournaments, community drives, and volunteer activities.</li>
          <li>To notify you of important community announcements and club updates.</li>
          <li><strong>Zero Commercial Sale:</strong> We will never sell, rent, or trade your personal information to third parties or advertisers.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Data Storage & Security</h2>
        <p>
          Your information is stored in secure, encrypted cloud infrastructure. Authentication sessions and sensitive tokens are protected using industry-standard HTTPS encryption and secure device storage.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Data Retention & Account Deletion</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to access, update, or permanently delete your account and all associated data at any time. To request account deletion or data removal, you can contact the club administration at <a href="mailto:vrn2252@gmail.com" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">vrn2252@gmail.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Google API Services User Data Policy Disclosure</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          FYC Connect's use and transfer to any other app of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-primary font-medium hover:underline">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-3">
          When you choose to sign in using your Google account:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
          <li><strong>Data Accessed:</strong> We access only your basic Google profile information (name, email address, and profile picture).</li>
          <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> This data is solely used to verify your identity, authenticate your session, and create your FYC member profile.</li>
          <li><strong>Data Sharing:</strong> We do NOT share, transfer, or sell your Google user data to third-party AI models, data brokers, or advertising networks.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Contact Information</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 text-sm">
          <p><strong>Friends Youth Club (FYC)</strong></p>
          <p>Email: <a href="mailto:vrn2252@gmail.com" class="text-primary font-medium">vrn2252@gmail.com</a></p>
          <p>Website: <a href="https://fycconnect.com" class="text-primary font-medium">https://fycconnect.com</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
